1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,030
Man: I've been thinking about getting into bird watching, any tips?

2
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:14,480
Woman: Sure, a good pair of binoculars is essential and instead of a guidebook

3
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,757
I'd recommend a mobile app.

4
00:00:16,757 --> 00:00:20,010
It helps you identify species and log sightings.

5
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:21,920
Man: I actually have an old field guide

6
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:25,070
but it's missing pages and doesn't cover local birds.

7
00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:26,737
Woman: Then get an app.

8
00:00:26,737 --> 00:00:28,180
Some of them even alert you

9
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:32,070
when there's a rare sighting nearby. That's my favorite feature.

10
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:36,020
Man: Impressive, so I'd like to join your group, too.

11
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,440
Woman: We'd love to have you

12
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:46,180
I'll send you a link to our calendar of events, including local walks.
